IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0031.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY INT0031C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 APPLIED-RATE       PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM 2000-RATE-TIER
    DISPLAY "APPLIED-RATE=" APPLIED-RATE
    STOP RUN.
2000-RATE-TIER.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN AC-ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S' AND AC-ACCT-BALANCE >= 50000
            MOVE 0.0425 TO APPLIED-RATE
        WHEN AC-ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S' AND AC-ACCT-BALANCE >= 10000
            MOVE 0.0325 TO APPLIED-RATE
        WHEN AC-ACCOUNT-TYPE = 'S'
            MOVE 0.0250 TO APPLIED-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0050 TO APPLIED-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
